# Challenges of Cloud Computing

Security Risks
👉 Data can be hacked if not secured properly
Internet Dependency
👉 Needs strong internet connection
Example: No internet = no access
Downtime
👉 Cloud service can go offline sometimes
Limited Control
👉 User has less control over infrastructure
Data Privacy Issues
👉 Sensitive data stored on third-party servers
Vendor Lock-in
👉 Difficult to switch from one cloud provider to another

